  "summary": "After injuries and illness forced Standish-Sterling to cancel, Shepherd High School in rural Michigan turned its first-ever homecoming football cancellation into a flag-football game between the varsity Bluejays and their dads on Friday, Oct. 9, keeping the band, cheerleaders and homecoming court in place.",
