  "body": [
   "SpaceX Super Intelligence \u2014 the Elon Musk company formerly known as xAI \u2014 has collapsed its separate AI and social subscriptions into one. On October 12, 2026, the company announced \"The X Subscription,\" a unified plan covering Grok chat, the agentic Grok Bot, the Cursor coding assistant and all X Premium features under a single bill.",
   "## Five tiers, one bill",
   "The new lineup spans five tiers: Free, Plus at $8 a month, Premium at $30 a month, Super at $100 a month and Ultra at $200 a month. AI usage caps rise with each tier, while the free tier gets limited chat and agent use. Grok and Cursor draw from one shared weekly usage allowance, and all subscriptions and billing are managed in a common workspace dashboard.",
   "The $30 Premium tier replaces plans the company says previously cost about $90 combined \u2014 SuperGrok plus Cursor Pro plus X Premium+. Access to the latest Grok models requires Premium or higher, and the Grok Bot assistant starts at the Premium tier.",
   "## What changes for existing subscribers",
   "Current subscribers can keep their existing plans or switch to the unified subscription. The upgrade option is rolling out gradually in billing settings, and switching cancels the old plans with prorated refunds \u2014 a change the company describes as permanent.",
   "## Context",
   "The move follows a rebranding push in which xAI became SpaceX Super Intelligence, or SpaceXSI, covering the combined xAI and X Corp operations. The company acquired the coding startup Cursor in August 2026, setting up the bundle announced this week."
  ],
