   "Sweat will sit out Week 6 at Atlanta and the Week 7 Thursday-night home game against New England on October 22. He is eligible for reinstatement on Friday, October 23, and would be back for Week 8 at Seattle. The news was first reported by ESPN's Adam Schefter.",
